        "id": 1031448
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T14:41:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "And I skipped that err argument in my fix because there is another function which is calling ufshcd_clock_scaling_unprepare() with only two args, so I also assumed that there might be one or more upstream commit(s) missing in android14-5.15 which didn\u0027t make the cut.",
      "parentUuid": "567da565_c1b7f8c7",
      "revId": "eb777277063c2e100698751561fc23aaa87d9877",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "25f63c67_a200d1bf",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869780
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T18:35:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The other function that calls ufshcd_clock_scaling_unprepare() occurs in the Android tree but not in the upstream kernel. That code is not upstream and can\u0027t be sent upstream before the Pixel 6 UFS Exynos driver has been sent upstream. The Pixel 6 UFS Exynos driver can\u0027t be sent upstream before its dependencies are upstream.",
      "parentUuid": "c053e926_84e68b50",
      "revId": "eb777277063c2e100698751561fc23aaa87d9877",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
